Subarrays with K Different Integers — #992
Key Idea

Instead of directly counting exactly K distinct values:

Exactly(K) = AtMost(K) - AtMost(K - 1)
Algorithm

For atMost(k):

Expand the right pointer.
Count each number using a HashMap.
If distinct values exceed k, move left.
Add right - left + 1.
Calculate the difference between atMost(K) and atMost(K-1).
